The TNF-alpha target alignment includes UniRef100 sequence records from the
UniProt Consortium, also under CC BY 4.0. See https://www.uniprot.org/uniref
and https://www.uniprot.org/help/license . The included alignment is a capped
version of the archived alignment; upstream sequence identifiers are preserved.
